# The professional judgment dojo uses your locally authenticated Codex CLI session.
# Run `codex login` once if `codex login status` does not report a signed-in account.
# No OPENAI_API_KEY is required for the dojo.
#
# The provider settings below configure only the legacy browser-agent harness.
# Select one legacy provider: openai, gemini, groq, or nvidia.
APPRENTICE_PROVIDER=openai

# Optional: override the provider's default model or OpenAI-compatible base URL.
# APPRENTICE_MODEL=gpt-5.6
# APPRENTICE_BASE_URL=https://example.com/v1

# The credentials below are only for the legacy harness. Set the key for its
# selected provider if you use that legacy flow.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=
